/* V1.6.5 蓝黑白高级感 自包含单排 5 项页内跳转坞（高度严格 <= 112rpx，非原生 tabBar） */
.ad-dock {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 40;
  background: #0F141C;
  border-top: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding: 10rpx 16rpx calc(10rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-sizing: border-box;
  animation: ad-up 220ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
}
@keyframes ad-up {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24rpx); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.ad-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  height: 88rpx;
  max-height: 112rpx;
}
.ad-item {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 88rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #0A0E14;
  border: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  color: #A9B4C2;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-right: 8rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  transition: transform 90ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 90ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), background-color 140ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.ad-item:last-child { margin-right: 0; }
.ad-item:active { transform: scale(0.985); opacity: 0.88; }
.ad-item.is-active {
  background: #16304F;
  border-color: #2E6BFF;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.ad-label {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.ad-daylight {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-top-color: rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.08);
}
.ad-daylight .ad-item {
  background: #FAFBFC;
  border-color: rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.08);
  color: #4A5568;
}
.ad-daylight .ad-item.is-active {
  background: #16304F;
  border-color: #16304F;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .ad-dock,
  .ad-item { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
}
